tory<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149090/extras/2e3f9e8ba812872d3e092eaa0517805e.webp?t=1742484366\" /></div>",
